msgid ""
"Also label images printed without an attachment ID (ACF fields, sliders, "
"builders) and CSS backgrounds (experimental, needs JavaScript)"
msgstr ""
"Označovat i obrázky vypsané bez ID přílohy (pole ACF, slidery, buildery) a "
"pozadí CSS (experimentální, vyžaduje JavaScript)"

